stateDiagram-v2
direction LR

%% Main app state flow based on AppState.screen in src/main.cpp / src/GameMenu/menu_shared.h
%% This focuses on the shipped main-game path, not every standalone demo executable.

[*] --> Boot
Boot --> MainMenu: normal startup
Boot --> Playing: VN_AUTO_START_STORY

state "Main App Game State" as MainApp {
    direction LR

    state "MainMenu" as MainMenu
    state "Playing\n(VN story progression)" as Playing
    state "Settings\n(from main menu)" as SettingsMain
    state "LoadMenu\n(from main menu)" as LoadMain
    state "PauseMenu\n(story pause)" as PauseStory
    state "Settings\n(from pause)" as SettingsPause
    state "LoadMenu\n(from pause)" as LoadPause
    state "PauseConfirmExit" as PauseConfirmExit
    state "PauseConfirmOverwriteSave" as PauseConfirmOverwrite
    state "BattleDemo\n(main-app battle state)" as BattleDemo
    state "Quit" as Quit

    MainMenu --> Playing: Start / beginStory()
    MainMenu --> LoadMain: Load
    MainMenu --> SettingsMain: Settings
    MainMenu --> BattleDemo: Battle
    MainMenu --> Quit: Exit

    SettingsMain --> MainMenu: Return
    LoadMain --> MainMenu: Back
    LoadMain --> Playing: Load success

    Playing --> PauseStory: Esc
    Playing --> BattleDemo: current VN entry has battleKey / battleId
    Playing --> MainMenu: end of chapter / script finished

    PauseStory --> Playing: Continue
    PauseStory --> SettingsPause: Settings
    PauseStory --> LoadPause: Load
    PauseStory --> PauseConfirmExit: Exit To Main Menu
    PauseStory --> PauseConfirmOverwrite: duplicate manual save detected

    SettingsPause --> PauseStory: Return
    LoadPause --> PauseStory: Back
    LoadPause --> Playing: Load success

    PauseConfirmExit --> PauseStory: Cancel
    PauseConfirmExit --> MainMenu: Confirm

    PauseConfirmOverwrite --> PauseStory: Cancel
    PauseConfirmOverwrite --> PauseStory: Save finished

    BattleDemo --> Playing: story-launched battle victory\nand story resumes / win script loads
    BattleDemo --> MainMenu: menu-launched battle ends\nor story battle fails / no continuation
}

Quit --> [*]

note right of MainMenu
  Main menu, story UI, story pause/load/settings
  use the front-ui RmlUi stack when ENABLE_RMLUI=ON.
  See:
  - src/graphics/front_ui_session.cpp
  - src/graphics/front_ui_*.cpp
end note

note right of Playing
  Playing is still driven by vn_system.
  The Rml story screen mirrors vn::PresentationState;
  it does not replace the VN runtime.
end note

note right of BattleDemo
  Despite the name, BattleDemo is also the in-story battle state.
  Main app battle path:
  battle::demo::Session
  -> BattlePartySetupScreen (if needed)
  -> BattleSessionCore
  -> optional DemoNarrativeFlow tutorial overlay

  This is the SDL battle path, not the standalone battle_testing path.
end note

note right of MainApp
  One AppState drives both front-ui screens and battle,
  but the renderer backend changes by screen:
  - front-ui screens: OpenGL + RmlUi
  - main-app battle: SDL renderer
end note
